; 20 hand-written transactions. Includes an allocate -> spend -> refund
; sequence for Dining Out (2026-01-15 / 2026-01-16) and two accounts
; (Electric, Water) rolling into one envelope (Utilities). Running
; Assets:Checking balance is checked at each month boundary below.

2026-01-01 * "Opening balance"
    Assets:Checking              3000.00 USD
    Equity:Opening-Balances

2026-01-02 * "Paycheck"
    Assets:Checking              2500.00 USD
    Income:Salary

2026-01-03 * "Rent"
    Assets:Checking             -1200.00 USD
    Expenses:Housing:Rent

2026-01-05 * "Groceries"
    Assets:Checking               -80.00 USD
    Expenses:Food:Groceries

2026-01-07 * "Dinner out"
    Assets:Checking               -40.00 USD
    Expenses:Food:Dining

2026-01-09 * "Gas"
    Assets:Checking               -35.00 USD
    Expenses:Transport:Gas

2026-01-11 * "Electric bill"
    Assets:Checking               -90.00 USD
    Expenses:Utilities:Electric

2026-01-13 * "Groceries"
    Assets:Checking               -70.00 USD
    Expenses:Food:Groceries

2026-01-15 * "Dinner out (overcharged)"
    Assets:Checking               -60.00 USD
    Expenses:Food:Dining

2026-01-16 * "Refund - overcharged dinner"
    Assets:Checking                60.00 USD
    Expenses:Food:Dining          -60.00 USD

